{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261102/photo/bkn-20261102195941530-1102_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261102214115\"/><p>3涉事車輛被帶離荃灣路調查。</p><p>荃灣發生3車串燒意外。今晚(2日)7時30分，一部紅色公共小巴，沿荃灣路往屯門方向駛至近葵順街遊樂場，意外與2輛私家車相撞。意外中共7名男女受傷，救護車到把他們送往瑪嘉烈醫院治療。事故原因有待調查。受意外影響，荃灣路往屯門方向近興芳路快線一度封閉。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T14:22:01.221339+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T11:59:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T14:18:38.034790+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T14:18:38.034790+00:00","content_hash":"b1d742a206b8f9e1976d6951ff6a9280c85449e44955d8f986034312a802d4d7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}